# Layer order (CR 613.1): the keyword is granted to whatever is a creature when layer 6 is applied: a Vehicle is
# not a creature until crewed, and once it is, Samut's "creatures you control have haste" covers it. Smuggler's Copter is cast on
# turn 1, crewed by Samut (summoning-sick creatures may crew) and attacks at once for 3 in the air.

